# Project

Kontur.Markirovka desktop app. Structure and run commands: see `AGENTS.md`.

## Working agreements

- Work on `main` locally; commit after meaningful steps; never `git push` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer editing `backend/` and `frontend/`. Do not grow `archive/legacy_ui/`.
- WMS embed / `ui_mobile` are removed — do not bring them back.
- Preserve business behavior when refactoring UI (ApiBridge methods stay the contract).
- Cookie background auth must stay off-screen + Win32 hide (see `AGENTS.md`).
